   "does": "Binding in display units: get = bodyWeightKg × (2.20462 if imperial else 1); set: nil or ≤0 clears bodyWeightKg, otherwise stores min(value/factor, BiometricsSettingsPage.maximumBodyWeightKg = 250) kg.",
